     "flexcontaineritem_45562908": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
      "text": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<h3>A Global Leader in High-Quality Digital Storage and Memory Solutions</h3>\r\n<p>Transcend is a global leader in digital storage, multimedia, and industrial products, operating 12 offices worldwide. It designs, manufactures, and sells a broad portfolio of 2,000+ products - including memory modules, flash cards, USB drives, SSDs, and industrial-grade solutions - to meet virtually any memory need.</p>\r\n<p>The company is committed to strict Total Quality Control, becoming the first Taiwan-based memory module maker to earn ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and QC080000 certifications. Every product undergoes rigorous testing to ensure reliability and long-term performance.</p>\r\n<p>Transcend delivers world-class embedded SSD and DRAM modules with industry-leading quality and availability.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     }
    }
   },
