    "text": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<ul>\r\n<li>15 high-speed SMT lines; 15 million pcs/month capacity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fully automated 35,000 m² factory floor</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>In-house R&amp;D and strict BOM control</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strategic partnership with Macnica Americas for embedded solutions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
